    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What health checkup packages are available in Ahmedabad at DHS Hospital?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">DHS Multispecialty Hospital offers seven health checkup packages tailored to different needs: <strong>DHS Advance Screening</strong> (basic blood, liver, kidney, cardiac tests), <strong>DHS Preventive</strong> (adds thyroid, HbA1c, vitamins, and pulmonary function test), <strong>DHS Comprehensive</strong> (adds USG Abdomen, Vitamin D, and ortho consultation), <strong>DHS Executive</strong> (adds 2D Echo, TMT, and cancer markers PSA/CA-125), <strong>DHS Executive Plus</strong> (full cardiac biomarkers — hs-CRP, Homocysteine, ApoLipoprotein), <strong>DHS Basic Cardiac</strong>, and <strong>DHS Advance Cardiac</strong>. All packages include physician consultation and report review.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What is the cost of a full body health check-up in Ahmedabad?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">DHS Multispecialty Hospital offers health check-up packages at competitive and transparent rates — from basic screening plans to comprehensive executive cardiac packages. For current pricing, call <a href="tel:+919081610444">+91 9081610444</a> or <a href="/appointment/">book online</a>. As a NABH-accredited hospital, DHS maintains high diagnostic standards while keeping packages affordable. Cashless insurance coverage may apply depending on your policy.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What is included in the DHS Executive Health Check-Up Package?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">The DHS Executive package is our most popular comprehensive check-up. It includes: CBC-ESR, complete liver function, kidney function, thyroid (T3, T4, TSH), diabetic profile (FBS, PPBS, HbA1c), cardiac profile (Lipid Profile, ECG, <strong>2D Echo, TMT</strong>), bone health, vitamins (B12, D), infection screening (HIV, HBsAg, HCV), <strong>cancer markers</strong> (PSA for males / CA-125 for females), chest X-ray, USG Abdomen, pulmonary function test, physician &amp; ortho consultation, and a complimentary breakfast.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Does DHS Hospital offer cardiac health check-up packages in Ahmedabad?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">Yes. DHS offers dedicated cardiac health check-ups — the <strong>DHS Basic Cardiac</strong> and <strong>DHS Advance Cardiac</strong> packages — which include ECG, 2D Echocardiography, TMT (Treadmill Stress Test), lipid profile, hs-CRP, Homocysteine, and physician consultation. The Executive and Executive Plus packages also feature complete cardiac profiling ideal for those with a family history of heart disease.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>How do I book a health check-up at DHS Hospital Ahmedabad?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">Booking is simple — call us at <a href="tel:+919081610444">+91 9081610444</a>, <a href="/appointment/">book online</a>, or walk in to our centre at 18 Sunrise Park Society, Vastrapur Lake — Drive-in Link Road, Gurukul, Ahmedabad. We recommend booking in advance to secure your preferred slot and morning fasting tests.</div>
    </details>

